# ADOX—Unsigned Integer Addition of Two Operands With Overflow Flag -- override
# 'DEST := DEST + SRC + OF;' with the carry out in OF and no other flag
# changed: the ALU's add with OF as the carry (AddOverflowCarry).
@operation
DEST := AddOverflowCarry(DEST, SRC);
@flags
The OF flag is set according to the carry. The CF, SF, ZF, AF and PF flags are not affected.
